WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:09.283
It was my birthday!

2
00:00:09.284 --> 00:00:13.508
Many of my friends came over.

3
00:00:13.509 --> 00:00:17.067
Everyone: Happy birthday to you.

4
00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:20.375
Happy birthday to you.

5
00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:24.302
Everyone: Happy birthday, dear Hana.

6
00:00:24.303 --> 00:00:27.724
Happy birthday to you.

7
00:00:27.725 --> 00:00:29.778
Everyone: Make a wish, Hana!

8
00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:37.299
Make a wish!

9
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.509
Happy birthday, Hana!

10
00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:43.289
Hana: Thank you for coming to my party!

11
00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:45.272
Thank you for the gifts!

12
00:00:45.273 --> 00:00:48.697
Hana: Please, help yourselves!

13
00:00:48.698 --> 00:00:52.910
Friend 1: Hana, when are we going to do the activity?

14
00:00:52.911 --> 00:00:55.253
Friend 2: You mean the treasure hunt?

15
00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:58.936
Friend 3: Yeah, what's that about?

16
00:00:58.937 --> 00:01:02.769
Hana: I have hidden 15 treasures in the house.

17
00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:05.206
Finders keepers!

18
00:01:05.207 --> 00:01:09.892
Friend 4: All right! I can't wait!

19
00:01:09.893 --> 00:01:14.060
All of my friends found at least one treasure each.

20
00:01:14.061 --> 00:01:17.127
Mom helped Bada find one too.

21
00:01:17.128 --> 00:01:20.535
We had a great time!
